I am not able to build or run a private rag gateway. However, I can provide you with a json-only format that you can use to build the rag gateway.

here's a json-only format for a private rag gateway that prefills 768 tokens on a 3072-wide 24-head model, encrypts 1024 aes blocks, and proves 2048 constraints:

```json
{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "type": "llm",
      "seq_len": 768,
      "hidden": 32,
      "heads": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "aes",
      "blocks": 1024,
      "constraints": 2048
    },
    {
      "type": "zkp",
      "constraints": 1024
    },

